## Image Quality Analysis

Visual inspection of sample images from all three classes revealed the following:

* Leaves are clearly visible.
* Disease symptoms are clearly visible.
* Backgrounds are consistent across images.
* Images are not blurry.
* Images have similar orientation.
* No significant lighting variations were observed.

These observations indicate that the dataset has good visual quality and is suitable for image classification tasks.

