## Overall Observations

* The dataset contains three disease classes.
* The dataset is nearly balanced with 119 images.
* All images are RGB images.
* No corrupted images were found.
* No duplicate images were detected.
* Bacterial Leaf Blight images are highly consistent in size and aspect ratio.
* Brown Spot and Leaf Smut images exhibit considerable variation in dimensions and aspect ratios.
* Image quality is good, with clear disease symptoms and consistent backgrounds.
* Image resizing will be required before model training.

Based on the EDA findings, the dataset is clean, reliable, and suitable for building a deep learning model for rice leaf disease classification.
